{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "fe70ac54433296e87896291f644cbaa6d901c99ca5cc0b149fd9bfe8f87188dd", "ja": "エターナルハーモニー", "zh": "『Eternal Harmony』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b45aff15a3e9ae004c0be53ebe5d25b8ab8e886080cb614dbc283f3ed7a6fc55", "ja": "エミリーのたっての希望で、キャンプに\nやってきたエターナルハーモニー。多少の\nトラブルはあったものの、夕食はなんとか\n完成。エミリーと空を見上げながら、明日\nからの日々に思いを馳せるプロデューサー。", "zh": "在艾蜜莉的强烈希望下，\n『Eternal Harmony』成员们来到露营场。\n虽然过程中有小状况，总算是做好晚餐。\n制作人与艾蜜莉一起仰望天空，\n同时想像起明天以后的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "73b45f75f79416d9f524719195c4142aa0bdd14d01a30f0449be2a50b73440d0", "ja": "（エターナルハーモニーの公演は大成功に終わった！\n今日はその打ち上げ、みんなでキャンプに来ている）", "zh": "（『Eternal Harmony』的公演成功圆满落幕了！\n今天大家为了举办庆功宴，一起来到露营场。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "0bd92acaf62205c8d83f70ba56d20432af529a783be886201f616e51ef1f0ddc", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、良いお天気でよかったですね。\n素晴らしい野営日和です♪", "zh": "策划执行人先生，幸好天气很晴朗呢。\n真是适合露营的美好天气♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "91c9391697b6b130970c692bfb7419c185c6b29f51bf7c4356e99fce7d97c71a", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nけど、打ち上げでキャンプに来ることになるとは……。", "zh": "嗯，就是说啊。\n不过，没想到庆功宴居然会跑来露营……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "61ecfcb46e3c01270e8d6d48ecdb9d5ac6983c50d1e10dddd3f19c6982617bf6", "ja": "え？\nあの、もしかして野営はお嫌いでしたか……？", "zh": "咦？\n请问，您该不会讨厌露营吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f2071082dd1481f490579c7a56450a4c3de9190489b958c259848d4405e59a8e", "ja": "いや、俺もみんなも楽しんでるよ。\nエミリーが言い出したのが少し意外だっただけで。", "zh": "不会，我跟其他人都玩得很开心喔。\n我只是很意外艾蜜莉会提议要来露营。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "327038a02fbb16948cd1b23c9835a55083aa8fa97d3062259122dbb5f3c43ce1", "ja": "エミリーは、どうして打ち上げに\nキャンプを選んだんだ？", "zh": "艾蜜莉为什么会选择露营当庆功宴呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "5e5fa1e2d7d0b1eca6c3bb0753dca4d75e7b3b9956c2ac4e96c3b03dceaf8c46", "ja": "それは……。永遠の交響曲のみなさんと、\nもう少し一緒に、何かをしたかったからです。", "zh": "那是因为……我想要和『永恒交响曲』的伙伴们，\n再相处久一点、再一起做些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "c1f51ba1136c71d0fac6ee8686c12fe1b434565838b4d7b02ee22fdca13e18fc", "ja": "これからも、劇場の舞台でご一緒することは\nたくさんあると思いますけど……。", "zh": "虽然我想今后还是有很多机会，\n能跟大家一起登上剧场的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "3bd730a58ce1deb3dd8d070128f9f08cbcdaca5fd592705a529cf67b471cd97e", "ja": "こうして5人だけで一緒に長い時間を過ごすことは、\n今までのようにできないかもしれません。だから……。", "zh": "但要像这样五个人长时间独处，\n机会可能就不比之前多了，所以我才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "a1733e3ea812129ef1536323c66c74975a4ab803c4685f7437ad73a4bd1a5b82", "ja": "うわーーー！！！", "zh": "哇啊───！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ab5df8e5fd61d86545f11dd88861826b8056a74a0ea54c36b834d56771ef13a2", "ja": "！？\nい、今の声は……。", "zh": "！？\n刚、刚才的叫声是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "adba22b498cb68a09b59add5b02dbc51bd913799587c5209b41db5fe60022620", "ja": "ジュリアさん……でしょうか……？\n参りましょう、仕掛け人さま！", "zh": "是……茱莉亚吗……？\n策划执行人先生，我们赶快过去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "d355fa1c508f5328ff5d9d621ad0acdb44261bd4dc72f88d2032c8adc4354228", "ja": "チッ、そうきたか……。\nだが、あたしは簡単には倒されないぜ！", "zh": "啧，来这招是吧……\n但我可不会那么轻易就被打倒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6b28b5a55f50620a79840c4004cbf3208a2c3a839e193b48561c57e3b6356d8b", "ja": "ジュリア……何してるんだ？", "zh": "茱莉亚……你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "fd346f62553fee9933a6058803456c9f4e4d8b26a1c73d2b9419c35532eb160a", "ja": "な、何って……見ればわかるだろ。\nハンバーグを焼いてるんだ！", "zh": "你、你问我在做什么……看也知道吧。\n我在烤汉堡排啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "9b5638c06b45480cb71062e1be335d06f9cbb6b6a3413b452d6b5c578641a408", "ja": "ケホッ、ケホッ。か、火力がすごくて、真っ黒焦げに\n……ジュリアさん、火加減を調整したほうが……。", "zh": "咳、咳，火、火力太强，都烤焦了……\n茱莉亚，调整一下火候会比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "80dc0ae8a4cf69ceac58119852091759576eefb8fa071ba6dfecd788c08685ea", "ja": "調整……こうか？\n……うわあっ！？", "zh": "调整……这样吗？\n……哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4988948a0e4a61973ebe478bb0257bddb5426c517fd2393c0c5f1811aa672424", "ja": "強くしてどうするんだ……！", "zh": "你怎么把火调强了啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "a5c428e6de572cc182d2a1996914c30e51f099b2fbedca19d196af5423ab61c6", "ja": "{$P$}、大変です！", "zh": "{$P$}，不好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "dc681c2d881893e7a4203f7a117a8cd0480a7ab4d53beff6251b796705d87fda", "ja": "ジュリアの次は千早か！　今度はどうした！", "zh": "茱莉亚之后换千早吗！这次是怎么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "e3bbd2f98295f8497c924711b8592f2592eb4526e1f4c83cc88b7588873046fa", "ja": "あの、カレーを作っていたのですが、\n隠し味にコーヒーを入れたら、変な味がして。", "zh": "那个，我刚才在做咖哩时想要提味，\n所以加了咖啡进去，味道就变得怪怪的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "69d91519dee1d61637c8cc77ec37773db3e68dfd6e69161170e3c7d01375edfd", "ja": "どれどれ？　……ぐっ、苦い……！\nコーヒーをどれだけ入れたらこんな味に……！", "zh": "我尝尝看……呜，好苦……！\n到底加了多少咖啡味道才会变成这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "e6928c21c6d55efaad6552aca623f6980eb222ba74bf84472f82494f2fc3adb5", "ja": "すみません……\nちょうどいい量がわからなくて、つい多めに……。", "zh": "对不起……\n因为我不清楚刚好的份量，就不小心加太多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "8eddd50ea23b74ccb2f020a9722b384018bd43e1b0430948f653f7c5197fb57c", "ja": "ふふっ、意外です！　ジュリアさんと千早さん、\nおふたりにも苦手なことがあったんですね？", "zh": "呵呵，我好意外！\n茱莉亚和千早原来也有不擅长的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "b02de9e1ddfaaeda83d95aa6a434d25531a1de6c430057bc968f7ae377115c39", "ja": "なんだそりゃ……\n人間なんだから、苦手なコトくらいあるって。", "zh": "什么意思啊……\n毕竟是人类，当然会有不擅长的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "fef920e192b835f7718957f4f00dcee81f4d5aa2f8482317e15be31dc857d6c5", "ja": "そうよエミリー、誰にでも苦手なことくらいは……。\n料理があまり得意でないくらい……くっ。", "zh": "就是说啊，艾蜜莉，每个人都会有不擅长的事……\n只不过是不太会做菜……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "027573b05636e23c89793bd208c393a83ae477b06e95801d9ee1da0c0dfe2cdb", "ja": "はい、そうですよね！\n……なんだか少し、安心しました。", "zh": "是啊，你们说得对！\n……我总觉得有点放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e22c7ddccb4f01c8d6f06ae82f32fdf120b0787f7a1d4d52aa44c6bfb2744214", "ja": "ただいま。飲み物持ってきたよ♪\n……あれ？", "zh": "我们拿饮料回来啰♪\n……奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "640e77f5eb712762bb8928c67eaed661600aff2b70d63f97464e779711c667e3", "ja": "なんだか、焦げたにおいがするのです。\nもしかして、大変なことになっているのです？", "zh": "好像闻到烧焦味了唷。\n难道现在情况很不妙的喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "94b6ad8bba61d7b02c69b6e1102bd92d6dbe92ad5dbc360f6930c53361564b43", "ja": "ああ、どうやらそうみたいだ。\nふたりとも、料理を手伝ってくれるか？", "zh": "嗯，看来似乎不太妙。\n你们两个可以来帮忙做菜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "bc9bbd5a5d323221ad2f93e9443480e78f06ce739255250f60ca08573fefa49e", "ja": "わかったのです。\n姫たちの安全な晩ごはんのために、頑張るのです。", "zh": "知道了喔。\n为了确保公主我们能吃到安全的晚餐，公主会努力的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "c20380969f1ad25c856d9e7bd33156a76de37ecbf4a4d2fa804607261e08dacb", "ja": "安全って言うな！！！", "zh": "不准用「安全」形容！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "833f6b8436f685636a4b15e2290baffe312b3455d98656184bdb18ebadefa992", "ja": "（その後、風花とまつり、エミリーの\nフォローで、なんとか食べられるものが完成した）", "zh": "（之后，在风花、茉莉和艾蜜莉的支援下，\n总算做出了能吃的东西。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a08ee8b1741334fa23c9954e5a1502bc297fe532f42de318d846832ab5fea499", "ja": "一時はどうなることかと思ったが……。\n無事にハンバーグカレーができて良かったよ。", "zh": "我刚才还在担心会怎么样呢……\n能平安无事完成汉堡排咖哩，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "47fcdf6ed3ca605f95506bbefffdf25615cd789b66c5bb73968e34c87c198239", "ja": "くぅ……。料理って難しいな……。", "zh": "呜……做菜真难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "128d44be12e369701a21ed9119e638c6319c1a906ae0f19fc099549093f2e8e0", "ja": "すみません、みんなに迷惑を……。", "zh": "对不起，给大家添麻烦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bd28a243aea178a1274176013463d985ac825a45415d0beb0f4392c131982598", "ja": "気にしなくてもいいんだよ、ふたりとも。\n誰にでも、得意なことと苦手なことがあるんだから。", "zh": "你们两个不用太在意啦，\n每个人都有擅长跟不擅长的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1037_041fuk", "source_sha256": "015c53d1dda8bec7ddeef52883da164f82cd96d0ed93873577e9fba767f10af2", "ja": "それに、みんなで料理するの、とっても楽しかったし。\nまたこうして、みんなで何か作ろうね♪", "zh": "而且能跟大家一起做菜也很开心，\n改天再一起来下厨吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1038_032emi", "source_sha256": "1178b39aa0ab043c537e5f5c8bf996fcaaf6e6a0fb6ecdc6dc32cf8ad38a1d42", "ja": "みなさん、冷たいお抹茶を淹れました。\nよかったら、どうぞ♪", "zh": "各位，我泡了冰抹茶，\n请用，希望各位不嫌弃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "6e2943b2f5b9f1e2dfe9b52b12223802a3ebebd29ea444f01c07d05060afdd9e", "ja": "ありがとうなのです、エミリーちゃん。\nお礼に、この抹茶マシュマロをあげるのです。", "zh": "谢谢你的喔，小艾蜜莉。\n作为回礼，给你这个抹茶棉花糖的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1040_032emi", "source_sha256": "4530b671cf1c8f3dd62d10f8947f896ad3de5676826d5ef68bdc0b257105aa14", "ja": "Oh！　ありがとうございます！\n……もぐもぐ。ん～、おいしいでしゅ……♪", "zh": "Oh！谢谢你！\n……（嚼嚼）嗯～好好吃窝……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "25a66caf6ac10a43036b9395983a0935a8c20338ca66644007a67566e344322d", "ja": "ははっ。ホントにうまそうに食べるな、エミリー♪", "zh": "哈哈，艾蜜莉，看你吃的样子感觉真的很好吃呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "8f2278d1129bd07046d71bae494c2a02900e41d4f5317293d8132d700c756111", "ja": "はっ。\nは、はしたなかったでしょうか……！？", "zh": "啊。\n会、会很不得体吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "dfbe4c08287014a21395bff110bb7f4fd021b1bdc8e940aeec095c57b63b9753", "ja": "まさか！　おしとやかな大和撫子もいいけど、\nそういうエミリーもカワイイと思うぜ？　あたしは。", "zh": "怎么会！端庄贤淑的大和抚子当然很不错，\n但我觉得这样的艾蜜莉也很可爱喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "dd3ea99eab627cffe1c461ab9077c57152b23bc408a8a3cd087e7aa5753eba6c", "ja": "ジュリアさん……あ、ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……谢、谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1045_032emi", "source_sha256": "414e7308a13424a04c23a6d8e97928114cd0226fe3701240cfc7f430e6402e2d", "ja": "で、ですが！　私は大和撫子を目指す身なので、\n今後は気をつけたいと思います！", "zh": "不、不过！我可是立志成为大和抚子之身，\n今后我会更加注意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1046_050jul", "source_sha256": "871ca46625b239d05d4fcac7b2f907013f8ba8e0c0397aae5f0623180d482cdf", "ja": "ははっ！\nやっぱそういうとこ、ロックだよな、エミリー！", "zh": "哈哈！\n艾蜜莉你这种想法真的很摇滚呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1047_p", "source_sha256": "a30ec3e2a715bc577e227b925a4f57e047425b713ef83b1bfcedb9963203a69f", "ja": "（みんな、思い思いにキャンプを楽しんでいる。\n打ち上げをこの場所にして正解だったな）", "zh": "（大家都以各自的方式在享受着露营。\n庆功宴来这里真是正确的选择啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1048_032emi", "source_sha256": "c0eb3674065ff3a66f4b88cf67221f560e8cfc23a7b5a0e01ac063e93731b3fb", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、こちらにいらしたんですね！\n仕掛け人さまも、冷たいお抹茶をどうぞ。", "zh": "策划执行人先生，原来您在这里啊！\n策划执行人先生也请喝冰抹茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1049_p", "source_sha256": "f15621450e987a7ed6b573cb902e6a4736b0dfea40f2f476a032e88b7e403e7b", "ja": "ありがとう。\n……むっ。おいしいな、この抹茶。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n……嗯，这抹茶真好喝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1050_032emi", "source_sha256": "a654831204dc15aa6b2c1da3cab7dbaac0f7bdab0cf5c7ba14c1dc45525de9e7", "ja": "お口にあったのでしたら、何よりです♪　……あの。\nお邪魔でなければ、お隣よろしいですか？", "zh": "合您胃口就好♪……请问，\n如果不会打扰到您的话，我可以坐在您旁边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1051_p", "source_sha256": "174ebaa4b05e5959c06b032146d0f618fcacb503a09e272ffa9adb758552da87", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1052_032emi", "source_sha256": "6029410fc8e184ffcdcdd09e69fa7f36a5b0c656a95e60d4ebf02852daca857a", "ja": "仕掛け人さま。今日は、こうして\n野営に連れて来てくださって、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "策划执行人先生，\n真的很谢谢您今天带我们来露营。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1053_032emi", "source_sha256": "8816b8cf93da3f2c06a81c000949fb23bb79f87d0b060b81fc25a18ba4a88584", "ja": "素敵な仲間と、素晴らしい時間を過ごせて、\nとても大切な思い出ができました。", "zh": "我和最棒的伙伴们一起度过了美好的时光，\n留下了非常重要的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1054_p", "source_sha256": "d18d63188e06dc9b6c11b7533fef99cd678ddd83623e1257c41a359e0962c93c", "ja": "そうか、それならよかった。\nエターナルハーモニーのステージ、頑張ったもんな。", "zh": "是吗，那真是太好了。\n毕竟你为了『Eternal Harmony』的表演很努力嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1055_032emi", "source_sha256": "380ba886fd47fe43109fbf7828e6d873e845d64b3f1388658c36e019ecd5d01a", "ja": "はい。永遠の交響曲の舞台が終わってしまうのは、\n少し……いえ、とても寂しいですが……。", "zh": "嗯，虽然『永恒交响曲』的表演结束了，\n让我有点……不，是非常寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1056_032emi", "source_sha256": "5cb3d45731804ee0cf355106b7385cbea04ce11790eb8e46d39c1f8f523d3b36", "ja": "けど、みなさんとは、これからも劇場で一緒ですから。\n私は今日のこの夕日を、きっと忘れません。", "zh": "但是今后，大家也都会一起待在剧场啊。\n我绝不会忘了今天的夕阳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1057_032emi", "source_sha256": "9c4d82efa9967e8cd6dfda21b454a2938005f54d8a54c5413679d710244cdce1", "ja": "……明日もまた、晴れるといいですね。\n仕掛け人さま。", "zh": "……真希望明天也会是晴天呢，\n策划执行人先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1058_p", "source_sha256": "d38f7cb781f56ab784dfdac1c6879f12c191cfb9381c20b994c9991441872f8e", "ja": "そうだな。きっと、晴れるさ。", "zh": "对啊，一定会是晴天的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1059_p", "source_sha256": "d545d7c91ee080acc494c6a0115a867416d6dd60cea515d022226a75a51d5d6c", "ja": "（明日も、明後日も。アイドル達の日々、\nそしてプロデュースは続いていく……）", "zh": "（明天、后天、从今以后，偶像们的日常，\n以及对她们的培育都还会持续下去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_07_1060_p", "source_sha256": "0f2a6b8b4d0c3f7687afe25bb61045005d76435772f0b9c7eec2d82519e35d50", "ja": "（明日からも、こんな風に澄みきった気持ちで……\nアイドル達と歩いていけるといいな）", "zh": "（希望明天之后，我也能带着这么明朗的心情……\n和偶像们一起继续往前走。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
